# T_SCRE: Ctrl-PgDn through the views of the loans and holds to the
# overdue rows, LOAN OVERDUE answered "-ERR 203" (the server refuses the
# list): the overdue list is shown empty under its own title with the
# failure message, not the rows of the view before; Ctrl-PgDn goes on to
# every row and back to the open rows.
S OPEN
K CPGDN CPGDN CPGDN CPGDN
S OVER
K CPGDN
S ALL
K CPGDN
S BACK
K ESC
